NOTE ON SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the source code of HealthLens.

It does NOT grant rights to third-party material that the software retrieves
or references at runtime, including but not limited to:

  * PubMed / MEDLINE abstract text, which remains under the copyright of the
    respective publishers (see backend/stance/data/README.md);
  * YouTube video content, transcripts, and captions;
  * any medical guideline or journal content cited by the tool.

HealthLens is an information-literacy aid. It is NOT medical advice, NOT a
diagnostic device, and NOT a substitute for consultation with a qualified
physician or pharmacist. The evidence summaries it produces are generated in
part by a local language model and can contain errors.
